<title>UK: Indosuez E.Europe traders moving to BNP.</title>
<headline>Indosuez E.Europe traders moving to BNP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A team of Indosuez Capital East European traders are moving to BNP Capital Markets, bankers involved in the change said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They said the team of six or seven will switch banks from next month, including Goran Lavovic and Peter Bartlett, managing director and vice-president of Indosuez Capital emerging markets respectively.</p>
<p>The team will cover fixed income and equities in East Europe as well as some other countries, including Cuba, North Korea Vietnam.</p>
<p>An Indosuez official described the departures as amicable and said the company had staff to replace those leaving.</p>
<p>A BNP spokesman declined comment.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Thatcher, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
